            "text": "American Fork resident Daniel Sroka joins Benjamin Gorman to discuss his meetings with Mayor Bradley Frost and Police Chief Cameron Paul following the police encounters involving Reckless Ben and others."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "Their conversation covers earlier AFPD cases, the chief’s responses to questions about the arrests, body-camera muting and redactions, and the role of citizen participation in police oversight."
          }
